      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXONERATE (1) finds it hard to win. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (20.57) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to his name from 14 starts. Capable of going well again. TERROR TORO (4) hit the ground running from the squeeze draw with a fast early split last time, but run over late and missed the frame when a 3 length fourth (20.61) over 350m at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Expected to run well. BOKARM QUINN (8) pinged the lids and was in the firing line early but drifted out of it when 5th at this track in Grade 5 company. Comes through a solid form race last start. Worth another chance. MINH CINDY (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to make amends.",
